\section{Conclusion}
In this paper, we proposed a globally convergent modified block Newton method(MBNL0R) for $\ell_0$ regularized optimization. The main difference between MBNL0R and NL0R \cite{zhou2021newton} lies in the use of approximate Jacobian matrix and the regularization. We prove that the proposed method is globally convergent. Leveraging the special structural properties of the NL0R method, we established the quadratic convergence rate for MBNL0R. The numerical results reveal the efficiency of our proposed method.

