The flows corresponding to the different ``times'', $t_j$ and $\tau_j$, all commute for all equations in Diagram 9 and Diagram 10.  That is
\begin{gather*}
  [Z_t,\ Z_{t_j}]=0,\quad
  [Z_t,\ Z_{\tau_j}]=0,\quad
  [Z_{t_i},\ Z_{t_j}]=0\\[0.3cm]
  [Z_{\tau_i},\ Z_{\tau_j}]=0,\quad
  [Z_{t_i},\ Z_{\tau_j}]=0,
\end{gather*}
where, for the equation $u_t=F(u,u_x,u_{xx},\ldots,u_{5x})$, we have
\begin{gather*}
